                <invention-title lang="en">TRACKED VIDEO ZOOMING</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for generating a picture-in-picture (PIP) window for displaying on a display device, the method comprising: identifying a tracked object within a video content; determining positional data associated with the tracked object across a plurality of video frames of the video content; and generating a floating PIP window for displaying, across the plurality of video frames of the video content, an enlarged version of the tracked object on the display device, wherein location of the floating PIP window across the plurality of video frames is determined based on the positional data associated with the tracked object.</p>
            </abstract>
